			],
			"Message": "chore(Maintain): Normalize shell syntax and formatting across build scripts\n\nApply consistent indentation and operator placement to the Maintain directory scripts to align with project linting standards. Remove unnecessary leading tabs in `case` blocks and standardize redirect operators (e.g., `2>/dev/null` instead of `2> /dev/null`) across all shell utilities.\n\nKey changes:\n- **Debug/Build.sh, Run.sh**: Remove tabs from `case` block bodies in Debug and Release profile definitions.\n- **Format.sh, Save.sh**: Standardize directory resolution to `>/dev/null` and fix `find` command piping in the shell formatter.\n- **Integration/SmokeProfiles.sh, Profile.sh, Release.sh**: Align `case` block indentation and merge split redirect operators for better readability.\n- **Script/CleanGenerated.sh, GenerateRouteManifest.sh**: Fix `grep`/`awk` piping and redirect spacing; standardize `find` output handling.\n- **Script/PostHogCapture.sh, ResolveIdentity.sh, SignBundle.sh**: Unify `2>/dev/null` usage and fix `codesign` command formatting in `SignBundle.sh`.\n\nThese changes ensure all shell scripts pass `shfmt` and `shellcheck` without warnings, improving CI reliability and code consistency.",
			"SHA": "dee3578f1d17eb95e8994be6b4e4bb0f4fb8094d"
		},
